As already mentioned, here is the trick:
Set the BIOS date to 2024
Install.
Set date back to present.

They will "time out" 455 days after teh BIOS date of when you installed.
If you try to set to later than 2024 they "wrap around" to 1910 ( or
something like that).
I suspect a precursor of the 2038 bug.

